{"seq":35,"slug":"ai-model-gateway-control-plane","title":"AI 模型网关与控制平面","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-native-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# AI 模型网关与控制平面简介\n\n当一个产品同时接入多家模型、多个区域和多种计费账户时，散落在业务代码里的 SDK 调用会迅速变成不可治理的供应链。\n\n本 hub 把模型网关视为一项平台能力：数据面负责执行一次受控调用，控制平面负责定义模型目录、能力、策略、预算、路由和发布版本。\n\n它不追求把所有供应商压成“最小公分母”，而是用稳定的领域契约承载共同语义，再通过能力协商和反腐层显式暴露差异。\n\n第一章**边界与统一契约**先划清应用、网关与供应商 SDK 的职责，再建立生成、工具调用和流式事件的规范模型，最后设计供应商反腐层。\n\n第二章**路由与韧性**把选择模型、超时重试、回退、对冲、熔断和故障隔离组织为有预算的决策链，避免“为了可用性制造重试风暴”。\n\n第三章**治理与容量**处理共享平台最难的边界：配额、准入、背压、身份、策略、多租户隔离、审计和数据保留。\n\n第四章**运营与演进**把遥测、成本归因、评测门禁、灰度发布、迁移和供应商故障演练闭成持续运行的控制循环。\n\n本 hub 与供应商 SDK 文档的分工很明确：SDK 文档解释某个请求如何发出，本 hub 解释组织如何在供应商变化时仍保持自己的业务契约和控制权。\n\n它也不替代通用 API 网关。通用网关擅长 TLS、HTTP 路由和边缘防护；模型网关还必须理解 Token、模型能力、工具调用轨迹、流式生命周期和语义质量。\n\n与模型路由、成本优化和评测方法论相关的兄弟 hub 各自深入单点算法；这里关注的是把这些能力装进同一条可审计、可回滚的生产链路。\n\n前置知识包括 HTTP 与服务端流式传输、超时和重试的基本语义、身份认证与授权、指标和追踪，以及至少一次真实的模型 API 集成经验。\n\n第一次建设平台的工程师应按四章顺读，先锁定契约，再增加路由和治理，最后接入运营闭环。\n\n已有单供应商生产系统的团队可以从第四章的迁移方法倒推：先建立影子流量和评测门，再回到第一章抽取现有调用契约。\n\nSRE 与平台负责人可先读第二、三章，明确容量保护与租户边界后，再与应用团队共同确定第一章的意图 API。\n\n读完后，你应能给出一份不依赖特定厂商的网关设计：每个决策有所有者，每次降级有预算，每条调用可归因，每次变更可验证和回退。\n\n延伸阅读（可选）：通用限流与熔断见[后端工程的限流、熔断与降级](../../58_backend-engineering/6_rate-limiting-circuit-breaking/)；任务难度与级联算法见[LLM 路由与级联](../../02_ai-llm/75_llm-routing-cascades/)；成本模型见[AI 成本与 Token 优化工程](../32_ai-cost-token-optimization/)；评测门设计见[Agentic 评估方法论](../34_agentic-evaluation-methodology/)。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-and-adapters","title":"边界与统一契约","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/contract-and-adapters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gateway-boundary","title":"模型网关的责任边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/contract-and-adapters/gateway-boundary"},{"seq":2,"slug":"canonical-generation-contract","title":"规范生成与流式契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/contract-and-adapters/canonical-generation-contract"},{"seq":3,"slug":"capability-anti-corruption-layer","title":"能力协商与供应商反腐层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/contract-and-adapters/capability-anti-corruption-layer"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-and-resilience","title":"路由与韧性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"routing-and-placement","title":"约束驱动的模型路由与放置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience/routing-and-placement"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fallback-retry-and-hedging","title":"回退、重试与对冲的尝试预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience/fallback-retry-and-hedging"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circuit-breaking-and-failure-containment","title":"熔断、舱壁与故障收敛","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/routing-and-resilience/circuit-breaking-and-failure-containment"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"governance-and-capacity","title":"治理与容量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/governance-and-capacity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quota-admission-and-backpressure","title":"配额、准入控制与背压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/governance-and-capacity/quota-admission-and-backpressure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"identity-policy-and-tenant-isolation","title":"身份、策略与多租户隔离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/governance-and-capacity/identity-policy-and-tenant-isolation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"audit-and-data-governance","title":"审计证据与数据治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/governance-and-capacity/audit-and-data-governance"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations-and-evolution","title":"运营与演进","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/operations-and-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observability-and-cost-attribution","title":"可观测性、成本归因与服务目标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/operations-and-evolution/observability-and-cost-attribution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evaluation-gates-and-rollouts","title":"评测门禁与渐进式发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/operations-and-evolution/evaluation-gates-and-rollouts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"migration-and-provider-failure-drills","title":"网关迁移、升级与供应商故障演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-model-gateway-control-plane/operations-and-evolution/migration-and-provider-failure-drills"}]}]}